{"version":1,"content":"<p>草蜢《THREE IN LOVE演唱會─澳門站》前晚及昨晚（24及25日）於澳門威尼斯人綜藝館舉行，座無虛席。</p><p>前晚頭場草蜢邀請觀眾席上「鐵粉」容祖兒合唱，昨晚第二場表演嘉賓則是老友古天樂。</p><p>除了跳唱《今期流行》外，他更以「演藝人協會會長」身分，宣布草蜢成為「健力士世界紀錄」的「華語最長壽不變陣組合」（Longest-running C-Pop Group with No Line-up Changes），全場同歡！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:24.535828+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:35:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.914853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:25.642643+00:00","content_hash":"c72ea823005861cfe05d31a2c7821f051c3264364743d6261b63d8d7f3bd29dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}